[REQUIREMENT]
UID: REQ-407
STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Overview
STATEMENT: This repository contains a complete collection of MILSTD498 (Military Standard 498) document templates in both HTML and Markdown formats. MILSTD498 is a United States military standard that defines the software development and documentation process for software systems.
RATIONALE: Converted from REPOSITORY_ANALYSIS.md heading.

