STATUS: Draft
TITLE: Document Structure
STATEMENT: Each document follows a standardized MILSTD498 structure with: **Section 1**: Scope (Identification, System Overview, Document Overview) **Section 2**: Referenced Documents **Section 3+**: Documentspecific content sections **Final Sections**: Notes and Appendices
